# Constants live in one file

Put reusable numbers, format strings, delays, and limits in `apps/web/lib/constants.ts`. Import them where they are used.

Do this for values that name a product or formatting choice (page size, debounce, date formats, time windows). Leave a value inline when it is used once and has no name worth sharing (a `0`, a `1`, a local index).

```ts
// constants.ts
export const SHORT_DATE_FORMAT = "MMM D, YYYY";
export const RELATIVE_DATE_WINDOW_MS = 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000;

// date.ts
import { RELATIVE_DATE_WINDOW_MS, SHORT_DATE_FORMAT } from "@/lib/constants";
```

Do not declare those values inside a component, hook, or helper.
